{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0890_musasi_01",
      "hash": "ef301e11683d2b10",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏「喂～\\n讓我們過去啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0890_rocketm_01",
      "hash": "9611c17128a694eb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不行！上面下了命令，\\n除了作戰人員之外一律不准過去。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0890_kojiro_01",
      "hash": "4e00beb778c8aafe",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎「別那麼死板嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0890_musasi_02",
      "hash": "ef302111683d3029",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏「真是的！\\n急死我了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0890_musasi_03",
      "hash": "ef302011683d2e76",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "廢　話　少　說\\n給　我　讓　開！！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0890_kojiro_02",
      "hash": "4e00bdb778c8a94b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎「喂～\\n等等我啊～武藏～"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0890_stop_01",
      "hash": "58540270d3db1c1a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我是警衛。\\n像[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳這種可疑的小孩……\\c\\n我是不會放[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳過去的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0890_stop_02",
      "hash": "58540170d3db1a67",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗚……"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0890_stop_03",
      "hash": "58540070d3db18b4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "他好像昏過去了……"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0890_max",
